# The working tree is LF everywhere, whatever `core.autocrlf` says locally.
# Biome formats with LF and .editorconfig declares LF, so a CRLF checkout (the
# default on Windows, and on GitHub's Windows runners) would fail `pnpm check`
# on every file. Pinning it here keeps the gate identical on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles: same rule, but never diffed in review.
pnpm-lock.yaml -diff linguist-generated

# Anything binary that may land here later.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
